{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04328","headline":"倡女行 · 乔知之","name":"倡女行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石榴酒，葡萄浆，兰桂芳，茱萸香。\n愿君驻金鞍，暂此共年芳。\n愿君解罗襦，一醉同匡牀。\n文君正新寡，结念在歌倡。\n昨宵绮帐迎韩寿，今朝罗袖引潘郎。\n莫吹羌笛惊邻里，不用琵琶喧洞房。\n且歌新夜曲，莫弄楚明光。\n此曲怨且艳，哀音断人肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"乔知之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04328.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04328","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}